Significance: minor
Type: added

A new "Send Email" page under GatherPress settings lets an administrator message every member on the site without going through an event. Members who turned event updates off in their profile are skipped, delivery runs on cron in batches so the page returns right away and a large membership is not sent in a single request, and the audience, batch size, and subject line are filterable through `gatherpress_site_message_recipients`, `gatherpress_site_message_batch_size`, `gatherpress_site_message_subject`, and `gatherpress_site_message_pre_enqueue_job`.
